### POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password

This endpoint is used to initiate the process of resetting a user's password by sending a reset link to the provided email address.

#### Request Body

- email (string, required): The email address for which the password reset link will be sent.


#### Response

The response for this request is a JSON object with the following properties:

- status (boolean): Indicates the status of the request. In this case, it will be true if the request was successful.

- message (string): A message related to the request, if any.

- data (null): The data property is null in this case.


#### Example Response

``` json
{
  "status": true,
  "message": "",
  "data": null
}

 ```

#### JSON Schema for Response

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "data": {
      "type": "null"
    }
  },
  "required": ["status", "message", "data"]
}

 ```

